{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1591","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"type":"divider"},{"runs":[{"text":"世味年来薄似纱，谁令骑马客京华。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"小楼一夜听春雨，深巷明朝卖杏花。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"矮纸斜行闲作草，晴窗细乳戏分茶。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"素衣莫起风尘叹，犹及清明可到家。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"divider"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔世味〕人世情味。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔年来〕近年以来。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔京华〕京城的美称，这里指南宋行在临安。南宋称京城临安为行在，有不忘旧都汴京而认临安为行都之意。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔小楼〕指诗人临安砖街巷寓所的南楼。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔矮纸〕短纸。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔草〕草书。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔细乳〕茶中的精品。一说指烹茶时浮起的乳白色泡沫。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔分茶〕宋元时煎茶之法。注汤后用箸搅茶乳，使汤水波纹幻变出种种形状。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"〔素衣莫起风尘叹〕不要有白衣被京城的风尘染黑之叹。陆机诗《为顾彦先赠妇》有“京洛多风尘，素衣化为缁”之语，这里即用其意。","type":"text"},{"alt":":paperclip:","mediaId":"media-731be13e40a3e11288a9","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔犹及清明可到家〕意思是，事毕后返回，还来得及在清明节到家。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"陆游的平生志愿是建功立业、收复失地，但长期得不到重用，使他深感希望渺茫，即使起知严州、来京陛辞，也提不起太多兴致，“谁令”一句，自问自悔，奠定了诗作的基调。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"颔联和颈联细写诗人一夜未眠，静听春雨，次日清早又遥闻深巷中叫卖杏花之声。白日漫长，所做之事无非是闲作草书、细乳分茶。雅则雅矣，却非志士所好。这两联写得细腻生动，闲适恬静，深为孝宗激赏，但其中的长夜不寐和日中无聊，其实都暗示着诗人的郁闷和惆怅。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"最后，诗人只好自我安慰：不必感慨京城的风尘之恶了，还是争取清明之前回到家乡吧。这既跟开篇两句绾合照应，又和中间四句自然贯通。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"诗作中间四句，通过一些日常细节，含蓄自然地传达出等待中的清闲落寞，诵读时要好好体会。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=768444","provider":"ctext","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=768444","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","type":"resource-link"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《剑南诗稿校注》卷十七（上海古籍出版社1985 年版）。\n\n此诗作于宋孝宗淳熙十三年（1186）陆游六十二岁时。此年春，诗人奉诏自家乡山阴（今浙江绍兴）赴临安（今浙江杭州），在寓所等候召见，写下了此诗。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=768444","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=768444","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b8%b4%e5%ae%89%e6%98%a5%e9%9b%a8%e5%88%9d%e9%9c%81-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b8%b4%e5%ae%89%e6%98%a5%e9%9b%a8%e5%88%9d%e9%9c%81-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e4%b8%b4%e5%ae%89%e6%98%a5%e9%9b%a8%e5%88%9d%e9%9c%81-%e9%99%86%e6%b8%b8","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":328792,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/6eff4e77af2cc9235f7990ce2793ccae628153c7.jpeg","height":1546,"id":"media-ef02800d037ea579fa9c","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"3f3f361acbd7388fe62a2b617fb98980fe043b5c264a0ccb4859679aac1662a3","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/6eff4e77af2cc9235f7990ce2793ccae628153c7.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1280},{"alt":"","bytes":448894,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/7/746dfdf01aa05b5502e9c0f228ee5e0c78d4c181.jpeg"